@anon.d1ff9934ece6813bf2a30f9ce237ed68.2646 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [534 x i8] }> <{ [534 x i8] c"# `inline_const_pat`\0A\0AThe tracking issue for this feature is: [#76001]\0A\0ASee also [`inline_const`](inline-const.md)\0A\0A------\0A\0AThis feature allows you to use inline constant expressions in pattern position:\0A\0A```rust\0A#![feature(inline_const_pat)]\0A\0Aconst fn one() -> i32 { 1 }\0A\0Alet some_int = 3;\0Amatch some_int {\0A    const { 1 + 2 } => println!(\22Matched 1 + 2\22),\0A    const { one() } => println!(\22Matched const fn returning 1\22),\0A    _ => println!(\22Didn't match anything :(\22),\0A}\0A```\0A\0A[#76001]: https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/76001\0A" }>, align 1
