@anon.d1ff9934ece6813bf2a30f9ce237ed68.3146 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [570 x i8] }> <{ [570 x i8] c"# `trait_upcasting`\0A\0AThe tracking issue for this feature is: [#65991]\0A\0A[#65991]: https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/65991\0A\0A------------------------\0A\0AThe `trait_upcasting` feature adds support for trait upcasting coercion. This allows a\0Atrait object of type `dyn Bar` to be cast to a trait object of type `dyn Foo`\0Aso long as `Bar: Foo`.\0A\0A```rust,edition2018\0A#![feature(trait_upcasting)]\0A#![allow(incomplete_features)]\0A\0Atrait Foo {}\0A\0Atrait Bar: Foo {}\0A\0Aimpl Foo for i32 {}\0A\0Aimpl<T: Foo + ?Sized> Bar for T {}\0A\0Alet bar: &dyn Bar = &123;\0Alet foo: &dyn Foo = bar;\0A```\0A" }>, align 1
